name: Banking and finance
tagline: "Financial crime on synthetic data - a first-look mule ring, hidden owners and a sanctioned person two hops up, card testing, account takeover and a common point of purchase, circular trade and phantom shipments, and a crypto peel chain cashing out, every Dataset mapped. The financial-crime tour joins when its pack gets a Basic tier."
